@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">About Swords and Ravens</h1>

<p>
    Swords and Ravens is a free, non-commercial fan implementation of <em>A Game of Thrones: The Board Game
    (Second Edition)</em>, playable directly in your browser. It was originally created by Longwelwind and is
    now maintained by <a class="link link-primary" href="https://github.com/gereon77" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gereon</a>,
    with the considerable help of:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside my-3">
    <li><b>Flutterbit</b> and <b>mmasztalerczuk</b> for their contributions to the codebase.</li>
    <li><b>Tex</b> for hosting communication about the game on the AGOT:BG Discord.</li>
    <li>
        <a class="link link-primary" href="https://liliannecoeverden.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>Lilianne Coeverden</b></a>
        for creating unique house themes and generously contributing them to this project. Special thanks to her!
        Visit her <a class="link link-primary" href="https://www.youtube.com/@@lilianne.coeverden" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube channel</a>
        for more content.
    </li>
    <li><b>DerSeynmaster</b>, <b>Jason77</b> and others for play-testing the game during the open beta-test.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">What's implemented?</h2>
<ul class="my-3 space-y-1">
    <li>
        <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> Base Game Second Edition</label>
        <ul class="ml-6 space-y-1">
            <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> Tides of Battle</label></li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> A Feast for Crows</label></li>
    <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> A Dance with Dragons</label></li>
    <li>
        <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> Mother of Dragons</label>
        <ul class="ml-6 space-y-1">
            <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> Vassals</label></li>
            <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> House Arryn</label></li>
            <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> Essos and House Targaryen</label></li>
            <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> Iron Bank</label></li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>

<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Roadmap</h2>
<p>Aside from game content, meta-game features are also planned:</p>
<ul class="my-3 space-y-1">
    <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" checked disabled /> Replays</label></li>
    <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" disabled /> Ranked games</label></li>
    <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" disabled /> Game statistics (win rates, ...)</label></li>
    <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" disabled /> Player statistics (kicked rate, ...)</label></li>
    <li><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="checkbox checkbox-sm" disabled /> Player reports &amp; moderation tools</label></li>
</ul>

<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">How to contribute?</h2>
<p>
    Swords and Ravens is fully open-source and the source code is available on
    <a class="link link-primary" href="https://github.com/Longwelwind/swords-and-ravens" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    Contributions, bug reports, or feedback are welcome!
</p>
<p class="mt-3">
    A <a class="link link-primary" href="https://discord.gg/6NhRrtV" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> server
    is also available for discussions about the platform.
</p>

<p class="mt-6">
    This site is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Fantasy Flight Games / Edge Studio.
    All board game intellectual property belongs to its respective owners.
</p>
